{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0186-s001", "text": "I Finland finns det olika sätt att finansiera vuxenstudier på.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T050623124538+0000-7/hb-c08-u0186-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.3509521484375, "generation_seconds": 14.22379984590225, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0186-s002", "text": "På vissa villkor kan man få olika typer av stöd, studielån och stipendier för sina studier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T050623124538+0000-7/hb-c08-u0186-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.28155517578125, "generation_seconds": 18.766491636866704, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0186-s003", "text": "Många studier kan avläggas vid sidan av ett heltidsarbete.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T050623124538+0000-7/hb-c08-u0186-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.3094482421875, "generation_seconds": 11.964498184854165, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0186-s004", "text": "Då kan man arbeta som vanligt och studera på kvällar eller helger.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T050623124538+0000-7/hb-c08-u0186-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.26885986328125, "generation_seconds": 15.319532159948722, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0186-s005", "text": "Det är vanligt att i synnerhet högskolestuderande finansierar sina studier genom att ha ett deltidsarbete vid sidan av studierna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T050623124538+0000-7/hb-c08-u0186-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.075918367346938, "peak": 0.275421142578125, "generation_seconds": 31.491014515049756, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0186-s006", "text": "Många studerande arbetar hellre deltid vid sidan av studierna än tar studielån.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T050623124538+0000-7/hb-c08-u0186-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.40655517578125, "generation_seconds": 20.20749409799464, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0187-s001", "text": "Att avlägga en hel examen kostar i allmänhet ingenting om den studerande bor permanent i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T050623124538+0000-7/hb-c08-u0187-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.31048583984375, "generation_seconds": 24.523880819091573, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0187-s002", "text": "Om man flyttar från utlandet till Finland för att studera, är man vanligtvis tvungen att själv finansiera sina studier och sitt liv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T050623124538+0000-7/hb-c08-u0187-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.702857142857143, "peak": 0.368804931640625, "generation_seconds": 40.193438202142715, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
